        <name>addJob</name>
        <qualifiedname>Manifest::addJob</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Starts one reading of the manifest, through the pool. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The manifest path and the toolchain argument are copied from the model on the calling thread. A running reading is removed when it has not started. Otherwise it is signalled and kept until it ends, and a newer reading waits in nextJob. The dependency command of a toolchain row blocks until its process ends, so the reading does not run on the message thread. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
