    <briefdescription>
<para>Reads the manifest on a pool thread, and sets the files child and the timeout of the model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A change of the manifest path starts one reading. The reading parses and validates the manifest, then builds the files child from the toolchain rows that match the toolchain argument. A failed validation sets the message, and the files child is empty. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
